{%- comment -%}
  The default message read "Serving Pennsylvania departments since 1985" until 2026-08-15. Nothing
  sourced that year, and four incompatible claims exist in the wild: 1945 (hub.biz), 1980
  (Buzzfile), 1985 (the previous owner's site copy), and a BBB "business started" date of 2005 that
  is a filing date rather than a founding one. Sixty years apart, none of them the client's own
  word — and a wrong "since 19XX" on a Johnstown storefront is exactly the line a local customer
  notices. The replacement claims only what the shop demonstrably does. Open decision
  `mtu-published-business-facts-20260815`.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="announcement">
  <div class="shell announcement__inner">
    <span>{{ section.settings.message }}</span>
    {%- if section.settings.link_label != blank -%}
      <a href="{{ section.settings.link_url }}">{{ section.settings.link_label }}</a>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Announcement bar",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "message", "label": "Message",
      "default": "Uniforms for Pennsylvania's first responders — walk-in tailoring, decoration, and on-site fittings." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "link_label", "label": "Link label", "default": "Call (814) 536-2390" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "link_url", "label": "Link URL", "default": "tel:+18145362390" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
